      "maxH": 560,
      "color": "orange",
      "text": "Amber Instrument. A precision instrument: bracketed readouts, a $ query hero and hairline panels, in amber on near-black.\n\nLayout: 12-column grid of hairline panels with labelled headers; left-aligned; one amber accent for the model.\nThe memorable thing: The $ query headline and the fit(prices) ≈ exact / recover(settings) = no readout.\nType: Schibsted Grotesk throughout: 700 for headlines, 900 for readout numbers, 400/500 for text.\nLight: bg #F3F2EE, surf #FFFFFF, ink #16170F, muted #67665E, acc #9E6108, line #D6D3C9\nDark: bg #0F100E, surf #151612, ink #EDEAE1, muted #95928A, acc #F0B24A, line #2C2D28\nMagnet rail on the left edge. Live prices on these boards are NSE closing prices from 25 Sep 2026; every chart is drawn from real data or the project's pricer."
    }
